<title>USA: Health Professionals sees Q2 loss narrowing.</title>
<headline>Health Professionals sees Q2 loss narrowing.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>In a letter to its shareholders, Health Professionals Inc said it expects a second quarter loss of about $200,000, a &quot;substantial improvement&quot; over the $936,000 loss it reported in its first quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>The company said the $200,000 expected loss will include about $300,000 in non-cash expenses.</p>
<p>Health Professionals said it anticipates the improvement after a management restructuring, expense reductions and an increase in operating revenue.</p>
</text>
